# Ignored in every repository, through core.excludesfile in .gitconfig.
#
# Only files that are never project content belong here: OS and editor debris,
# local-only helpers, and files that hold secrets. Anything else is up to each
# project's .gitignore; a pattern here hides matching files from `git status`
# in every repo without warning.

